{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<strong>Silent Oaths</strong>\u201d is a strategy game that blends card-based roguelike mechanics with role-playing elements. Transported to a parallel world, you may become a knight in service of a magical lord, a plague doctor dedicated to the pursuit of knowledge, or a devout nun steadfast in her vows. Along your journey, you will encounter heroes of the magical kingdom, discover the world\u2019s true crisis through the choices you make, and embark on an adventure to unveil the secrets of this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your sword, meet companions on the journey, search for relics, pick up new cards, and fight monsters and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, you will meet a proud magical lord willing to sacrifice himself for his people, a brave and resolute nun, and a silent, vengeful knight bound by oath. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the peaceful calm, the foreign undead are brewing a catastrophic disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the heroes unite the heroes and use the power of the entire world to fight against the foreign enemies, or collect magic weapons and reverse the situation with their own strength to become lone heroes; or even turn to the dark side for power, using the enemy's spear to attack their shield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining rouge cards with role - playing, choosing different plot branches, collecting cards and magic weapons, constantly strengthening the protagonist's power, and deriving different plot branches according to the players' different choices. Get prepared for the ultimate battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Screenshots: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras/d9fb77517d09c3d54bcc9d637774a6da.avif?t=1753353071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras_big/d9fb77517d09c3d54bcc9d637774a6da.avif?t=1753353071 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras/bf13c68212c94b3d3f3ffec2f879cf91.poster.avif?t=1753353071\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras/bf13c68212c94b3d3f3ffec2f879cf91.webm?t=1753353071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras/246d3fe45c10f7531f2355ecf2002b89.poster.avif?t=1753353071\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/extras/246d3fe45c10f7531f2355ecf2002b89.webm?t=1753353071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477870?t=1753353071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/3fdc2a10732362eff66767aa33d24c4d355d9405/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753353071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477870/9fc7d42adb69709e85c3fc8d0b8edd04b03660a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753353071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta